; Entry of a small Survex tree whose fixes live in different files. The
; entry writes no *begin of its own, so its fix R0 belongs to the source
; root, and each included file's *begin block becomes a derived node:
; entrances (two bare fixes, one a reference), deep/lower (a fix under its
; own *cs), and deep/empty (no fix at all). No file names a *cs out.
*fix R0 100 200 300
*data normal from to tape compass clino
R0 R1 10.0 0 0
*include "entrances"
*include "deep/lower"
*include "deep/empty"
; Ties the fixless block to the entry's fix so cavern can place it.
*equate R1 empty.X1
